        "q1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Natural hair care by Unify Organica",
            "text": "<p>Unify Organica Hair Oil combines natural oils and herbal extracts to nourish the scalp, reduce hair fall and add natural shine. Pair it with Unify Organica Hair Shampoo, made with aloe vera, hibiscus and herbal extracts, for a gentle daily routine that strengthens hair from root to tip.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Joints Oil for knees and joints",
            "text": "<p>Unify Organica Joints Oil is a blend of natural herbal oils made for massaging knees and joints. Warm a few drops between your palms and massage gently for a soothing daily ritual.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Body wash and hand wash for the whole family",
            "text": "<p>Our Body Wash with aloe vera and cucumber extract keeps skin refreshed and hydrated, while our Hand Wash with lemon extract cleans gently and leaves a fresh fragrance. Both come in generous 200 ml bottles with cash on delivery across Pakistan.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
